gonna love "Hobbs &amp; Shaw."

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:21.888
-You're gonna get into this.
Yeah.

00:00:21.888 --> 00:00:23.156
-Yes, yes.
-And who is in it?

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:25.592
Now, it's you and --
-It's myself, Jason Statham.

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:27.860
The second sexiest man alive,
Idris Elba.

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.362
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:00:30.362 --> 00:00:31.597
-The second. Yeah.
-Yes.

00:00:31.597 --> 00:00:33.199
-Hello, I'm the first.
Yeah.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:34.833
[ Laughter ]
-Vanessa Kirby is in it.

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:37.203
-Oh, Vanessa Kirby is great.
-Vanessa Kirby's great.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.905
-But there's like --
It's over-the-top action.

00:00:39.905 --> 00:00:41.441
-Over-the-top action.

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:44.476
It is bombastic.
It is a big, big summer movie.

00:00:44.476 --> 00:00:46.345
And, also,
what I wanted to do was,

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:47.947
of course, pay attention
and pay homage

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:50.816
to the "Fast &amp; Furious"
universe -- the anchors,

00:00:50.816 --> 00:00:54.987
like, fast cars, cool cars,
big action, family element.

00:00:54.987 --> 00:00:56.389
But I also want
to have our own identity.

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:57.557
You know?
-Yeah.

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.659
-With that then
came all the great comedy.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.394
-Dude, it's really funny.
-And we went out.

00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:03.930
We got a few surprises littered.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.297
-I think people
are gonna go crazy.

00:01:05.297 --> 00:01:06.799
There's a couple
good cameos in there.

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:09.201
-Couple good cameos.
Setting up the future team.

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:11.704
-You can't say who...?
-I can't say who it is.

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:13.006
No, no, no.

00:01:13.006 --> 00:01:15.508
-If I went down the list
of possible cameos...

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.876
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:18.877
...and then maybe just judging
by your reaction maybe.

00:01:18.877 --> 00:01:20.112
-Just by my reaction.

00:01:20.112 --> 00:01:21.147
-Yeah, I mean,
you don't have to say anything.

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:25.852
-I won't say words, then.
-Beyoncé.

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:28.254
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:30.456
Oprah.

00:01:30.456 --> 00:01:32.859
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:35.428
Kevin Hart.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:43.970
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:46.405
He just makes you smile, huh?

00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:48.341
Cardi B.

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:50.810
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:53.279
Ryan Reynolds?

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:56.583
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.583 --> 00:02:00.252
Dude, it's --
I'm gonna say in the movie,

00:02:00.252 --> 00:02:03.222
the trash talking
between you and Statham --

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:04.423
-Statham is --
-Jason Statham is --

00:02:04.423 --> 00:02:06.859
Dude, you guys rip each other.
-We do. We do.

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:08.928
-It's great!
-And what's great about that,

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:10.596
Like, we discovered
we had this chemistry

00:02:10.596 --> 00:02:11.997
in "Fast 8."
-Yeah.

00:02:11.997 --> 00:02:14.433
-So then that was the launching
pad for this movie.

00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:19.439
And what's great about Jason is,
you know, he is so by-the-book,

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:20.740
and he likes to read what --

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.675
he likes to act
what is on the page.

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.009
And I do, too.
-Yeah.

00:02:24.009 --> 00:02:25.979
-But, you know, like you,
we like to play.

00:02:25.979 --> 00:02:27.179
Let's stretch the scene out
a little bit.

00:02:27.179 --> 00:02:28.714
-Let's have fun, yeah.
-Let's have fun.

00:02:28.714 --> 00:02:30.182
So I get to set,
and I'm like, "Okay, listen.

00:02:30.182 --> 00:02:31.517
I'm gonna say something to you.

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:32.718
I'm not gonna tell you
what it is.

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:33.786
Just go with it."

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:35.421
And he's like,
"I don't know, mate."

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:36.556
I'm like, "That's okay."
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:38.291
-That's -- yeah.
That's how he talks.

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:39.726
-"I don't know, mate."
-"I don't know, mate."

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:41.527
-Yeah, "it's okay, it's okay."
-"I don't think I like it."

00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:42.929
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.929 --> 00:02:45.364
"I don't know."
And then I say something

00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:48.133
