and your ass will die anyway.

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:03.582
So, it's up to you."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.582 --> 00:03:05.017
-That's hilarious.
-"So it's up to you."

00:03:05.017 --> 00:03:08.220
-But you also wrote
some burns for yourself?

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:09.622
-Oh, and that's what I do, too.

00:03:09.622 --> 00:03:13.293
So that's the balance with
Jason Statham or with anybody.

00:03:13.293 --> 00:03:16.262
So, if I'm gonna talk trash
in these scenes, and that's --

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:18.464
This is all "Hobbs &amp; Shaw" is,
by the way...

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:19.698
-Yeah.

00:03:19.698 --> 00:03:21.601
-...of just this great banter
