00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:25.505
then I offer up, "And here's
what you could say about me."

00:03:25.505 --> 00:03:27.339
So, for example,
I said this on day one.

00:03:27.339 --> 00:03:28.374
This was our first day
of shooting.

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:30.877
I said, "Listen."
And it's day one.

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:32.711
"I know -- here's the script."
-Yep.

00:03:32.711 --> 00:03:34.380
-"And we're gonna say
what's here.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:36.482
But, you know, let's --"
-Yeah.

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:37.550
-"Let's play a little bit,
