00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:38.885
-Yeah.
-So then I -- then I say --

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:41.554
-Now I'm nervous.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:44.090
-Then I say --
And this made the movie.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:45.592
